"[Pick session]                                                                  "
"┌Sessions─────────────────┐┌Windows─────────────────┐┌Panes────────────────────┐"
"│ *╭Help — picker bindings────────────────────────────────────────────────╮  │"
"│   │h                 Focus previous column                               │   │"
"│   │<Left>            Focus previous column                               │   │"
"│   │l                 Focus next column                                   │   │"
"│   │<Right>           Focus next column                                   │   │"
"│   │g g               Go to top                                           │   │"
"│   │G                 Go to bottom                                        │   │"
"│   │<PageUp>          Previous page                                       │   │"
"│   │<PageDown>        Next page                                           │   │"
"└───│<C-u>             Scroll preview up half a page                       │───┘"
"╭wor│<C-d>             Scroll preview down half a page                     │───╮"
"│red│<Enter>           Pick hovered target                                 │   │"
"│rea│q                 Quit without picking                                │   │"
"│$ c│<Esc>             Dismiss popup or message                            │   │"
"│all│a                 Create session or window                            │   │"
"│   │r                 Rename session or window                            │   │"
"│   │d d               Delete hovered item                                 │   │"
